=\"1035\"><p data-start=\"954\" data-end=\"1035\">✅ <strong data-start=\"956\" data-end=\"974\">10% commission</strong> on every sale made through your referral link or coupon code</p></li><li data-start=\"1036\" data-end=\"1063\"><p data-start=\"1038\" data-end=\"1063\">💳 Payouts made regularly</p></li><li data-start=\"1064\" data-end=\"1114\"><p data-start=\"1066\" data-end=\"1114\">🧾 Full transparency via your personal dashboard</p></li></ul><hr data-start=\"1116\" data-end=\"1119\"><h3 data-start=\"1121\" data-end=\"1149\">📣 <strong data-start=\"1128\" data-end=\"1149\">How to Promote Us</strong></h3><ul data-start=\"1150\" data-end=\"1393\"><li data-start=\"1150\" data-end=\"1222\"><p data-start=\"1152\" data-end=\"1222\">🖼 Share product photos and videos on <strong data-start=\"1190\" data-end=\"1222\">Instagram, TikTok, Pinterest</strong></p></li><li data-start=\"1223\" data-end=\"1273\"><p data-start=\"1225\" data-end=\"1273\">✍️ Write <strong data-start=\"1234\" data-end=\"1250\">blog reviews</strong> or <strong data-start=\"1254\" data-end=\"1273\">home decor tips</strong></p></li><li data-start=\"1274\" data-end=\"1326\"><p data-start=\"1276\" data-end=\"1326\">🎥 Create <strong data-start=\"1286\" data-end=\"1326\">YouTube product reviews or unboxings</strong></p></li><li data-start=\"1327\" data-end=\"1393\"><p data-start=\"1329\" data-end=\"1393\">💬 Offer a <strong data-start=\"1340\" data-end=\"1354\">promo code</strong> to your audience for better conversion</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"1395\" data-end=\"1482\">We provide all necessary <strong data-start=\"1420\" data-end=\"1461\">banners, visuals, and product details</strong> to help you succeed.</p><hr data-start=\"1484\" data-end=\"1487\"><h3 data-start=\"1489\" data-end=\"1517\">📌 <strong data-start=\"1496\" data-end=\"1517\">Other Information</strong></h3><ul data-start=\"1518\" data-end=\"1865\"><li data-start=\"1518\" data-end=\"1622\"><p data-start=\"1520\" data-end=\"1622\">🔗 Easy sign-up via